OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of woman, 81, in
OL,4,A'brutal assault'                       
OL,6,FA 37-year-old man has pleaded not      
OL,7,Fguilty to the murder and serious sexual
OL,8,Fassault of an 81-year-old woman.       
OL,10,FEdward Holden, of Alexandra Place,     
OL,11,FPenzance, pleaded guilty to            
OL,12,Fmanslaughter and two sexual offences   
OL,13,Fafter Jenny Firth was found dead at her
OL,14,Fhome in the village of Ashton, near    
OL,15,FHelston, on 29 May.                    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
