OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of woman, 81, in
OL,4,A'brutal assault'                       
OL,6,FProsecutor Anna Vigars KC told Truro   
OL,7,FCrown Court on Monday that Holden had  
OL,8,Fbeen high on cocaine when he had       
OL,9,Fcarried out an "extended, brutal,      
OL,10,Fforceful sex assault" on the pensioner,
OL,11,Fwho suffered blunt force impact to the 
OL,12,Fhead, spinal injury and had been       
OL,13,Fasphyxiated.                           
OL,15,F"She may well have tried to defend     
OL,16,Fherself but she was 81, five feet four 
OL,17,Finches tall and weighed less than eight
OL,18,Fstone [51kg]. She did not stand a      
OL,19,Fchance," she added.                    
